      "description": "Built-in deterministic node.",
      "documentation": "# Boolean Constant\n\nEmits a fixed `Boolean` value configured on the node (no input pins).\n\n## Inputs\n\n| Pin | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| *(editor)* **Value** | Editable `true` / `false` on the node body |\n\n## Outputs\n\n| Pin | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| **Value** | Constant `Boolean` |\n\n## Usage\n\nSupply flags to **Branch**, **And**/**Or**, or **Set Variable**. Change the literal in the node UI without rewiring.\n",
      "iconId": "builtin.constants",
      "nodeTypeId": "yssbi.constant.bool",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "description": "The constant value.",
          "key": "value",
          "title": "Value"
        }
      ],
