      },
      "description": "Performs a typed tabular operation.",
      "documentation": "# Get DataFrame\n\nLoad a project **DataFrame** from the database by node instance parameter. The node emits a **DataFrame** reference on the output pin for downstream data nodes.\n\n## Pins\n\n| Pin | Direction | Description |\n|-----|-----------|-------------|\n| **DataFrame** | Output | Reference to the selected table in the project database |\n\n## Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| **DataFrame** | Select which project database table this node loads (node inspector) |\n\n## Usage\n\nPlace **Get DataFrame** at the start of a data pipeline. Choose the target table in the node inspector, then wire **DataFrame** to **Decompose DataFrame**, **Filter DataFrame**, regression nodes, or other consumers. Schema propagation uses the selected table so dynamic pins resolve correctly downstream.\n",
      "iconId": "builtin.dataframe",
      "nodeTypeId": "yssbi.dataframe.source.get",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "description": "Typed node parameter.",
          "key": "dataframe",
          "title": "dataframe"
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "direction": "output",
          "key": "dataframe",
          "kind": "data",
          "label": "DataFrame"
        }
      ],
      "resourceNames": [
        "Contract Database"
      ],
      "resourcePath": "databases/contract-database",
      "resourceRevision": 13,
      "styleId": "builtin.dataframe",
      "technicalTerms": [
        "Contract Database",
        "data frame",
        "source",
        "table"
      ],
      "title": "Contract Database"
    },
